			Objective-C classes are not module-qualified, so use the bare
			class name here (no `$(PRODUCT_MODULE_NAME).` prefix). A dotted
			name would cause NSClassFromString() to return nil and Quick Look
			would silently fall back to the thumbnail.
		-->
